Z||000005||jch82||09-27-2001||12:23 PM||||any spots that go through the factory paint should be primed. some people just prime the entire car. your prep job is directly related to the quality of the paint job. there are no shortcuts.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW, im only about 40mi north of zeeland. we should get a few people together sometime. ken (moocow) wouldnt be able to bring his 87gt due to a blown tranny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  but he could ride with me or something. <P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jch82.jpg"> ||||reg||7
